index 2ee8bc0a..2c8d5848 100644
--- a/ChangeLog
+++ b/ChangeLog
@@ -11,6 +11,12 @@ Release date: TBA
 
 * astroid has been upgraded to 2.6.0
 
+* ``pyreverse`` now uses PEP 484 type hints of function arguments and annotated
+  assignments to display attribute types (e.g. ``a : Optional[str]`` for ``a: str = None``),
+  and shows argument annotations in method signatures of ``dot`` diagrams.
+
+  Closes #1548
+
 * Fix false positive ``useless-type-doc`` on ignored argument using ``pylint.extensions.docparams``
   when a function was typed using pep484 but not inside the docstring.
 
